{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は名古屋の全国握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日差しの強い中、予想以上にたくさんの方が来てくださって\nとっても楽しかったです♪\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のミニライブでは、「ハウス！」が初披露でしたo(^-^)o\nどうでしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが盛り上がってくれてうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、「ハウス〜」の所の振りは\n犬のイメージなので、次見るとき注目してみてくださいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初のみんなでやるウェーブも見所です＼(´∀｀)丿＼(´∀｀)丿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、舞台でせいらりんの誕生サプライズもやっちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オメデトー♪ヽ(〃・ω・)ノ☆゜'・:*☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいらりんはいつも笑ってて優しくて、\n私もよく相手してもらってます(^w^)\nこれからもよろしくね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は今日もみなさんと色々話せて\n力をもらったり、おもしろかったり、うれしかったり\nいっぱい笑いました(^O^)\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しくてワァヤァやってるうちに\n制服でメンバーと写真撮るの忘れてました...\nすいません(´・_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代わりに、串カツとみなみと撮った写メです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え、これじゃ足りないって？\nしょうがない。じゃあこれで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"右ほっぺが若干膨らんでるのは串カツ食べてるからです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/19/3516477/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしても今日は暑かったですね(汗)\nお風呂でも入ってゆっくり休んでくださいねd(゜ー゜*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}